        <activityName xml:lang="en">Precast concrete, standard concrete, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Precast concrete, standard concrete, at plant
Dataset describes the production of standard precast concrete elements using partly self compacting concrete and producing elements of a structural robustness below C70. Excludes the transportation to the construction site;
UUID: 035b7898-4a2f-351d-821b-3dd1cdf0b9d3
Includes infrastructure, energy demand, material demand, treatment of wastes, transportation
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Formation with wooden boards
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_035b7898-4a2f-351d-821b-3dd1cdf0b9d3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
